============================================================
SCAN API BEHAVIOUR
============================================================

When a user scans:

1. Receive QR payload.
2. Validate input.
3. Determine payload type.
4. If URL:
   - normalize URL
   - fingerprint it
   - perform controlled analysis
   - inspect redirect chain
   - inspect destination
   - check history
   - check community reports
   - calculate risk
5. Store observation where appropriate.
6. Return structured result.
7. Frontend displays warning.
8. User chooses whether to open.

